      "title": "Switch 2 passes 26.35 million as Nintendo posts Q2 results",
      "tags": [
        "Switch 2",
        "Nintendo"
      ],
      "body": "Nintendo's July–September numbers put Switch 2 lifetime shipments at 26.35 million after 2.67 million last quarter. First-half hardware was down 37.4% year-on-year to 6.49 million, but Switch 2 software rose 18.8% to 24.49 million. Pokémon Pokopia sits at about 5.3 million worldwide, Fire Emblem: Fortune's Weave hit 1.34 million in two weeks, and the full-year Switch 2 forecast stays at 16.5 million.",
